<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lubrizol Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lubrizol Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co analyst Saul Ludwig raised his rating on Lubrizol Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that Lubrizol will report a 32 percent gain in earnings per share in the fourth quarter of 1996, and in 1997 will see EPS grow 15 percent to a new all-time record of $2.45, up from an estimated $2.15 in 1996,&quot; Ludwig said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 30-3/8.</p>
</text>
